                                                                                
 Usage: opentide setup skills discover [OPTIONS] [path]                         
                                                                                
 List skills from the opentidehq/skills catalogue.                              
                                                                                
╭─ Options ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────╮
│ --path       -C      <str>  Repository path [default: .]                     │
│ --query      -q      <str>  Keep skills whose name, slug or description      │
│                             holds this text                                  │
│ --installed                 Keep only the skills installed in                │
│                             .agents/skills/                                  │
│ --refresh                   Fetch the catalogue again, not the in-process    │
│                             copy of the last 30s                             │
│ --help                      Show this message and exit.                      │
╰──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────╯

 Examples
   $ opentide setup skills discover --query sigma
